Use ISO dates. Replace `Pending` values as answers arrive. When interrupted or blocked, update `Last updated` and `Resume notes` before stopping. A checkbox is checked only after its observable result is complete.

For each MCP checkpoint, explicitly offer the integration even if the user has not mentioned it. Briefly explain why the product may need it when asking. If accepted, write and verify its project-scoped configuration before checking the item. If declined, replace the item with `- [x] Neon MCP declined`, `- [x] PostHog MCP declined`, or `- [x] Resend MCP declined`. Treat the choices independently.

{{#mobile}}
